# Raise the G4RadioactiveDecay time threshold to cover 41Ar (T1/2 = 6600 s) and
# everything shorter. The geological isotopes (39Ar, 36Cl, 35S, 37Ar) stay above
# it and are still treated as stable. The unit is mandatory: a bare number is
# rejected and the threshold left unset, which is visible only in the g4 log.
/process/had/rdm/thresholdForVeryLongDecayTime 1.0e+14 ns
